{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13208170","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13208170","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1320817001:1":{"text":"嚯嚯，朋友，最近风雪很大，会有野兽来洞内取暖歇息。","source_cn":"嚯嚯，朋友，最近风雪很大，会有野兽来洞内取暖歇息。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA3035BD3FC804D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1320817002:1":{"text":"你回家时注意些，让之后换班来采集的人配好武器，保障安全。","source_cn":"你回家时注意些，让之后换班来采集的人配好武器，保障安全。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F0BDE423587CD6F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1320817003:1":{"text":"什么？你们是特意赶回来的？","source_cn":"什么？你们是特意赶回来的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CCE774611F6561F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320817004:1":{"text":"我也准备收工了，等把开凿出来的矿石运到冶炼处，我就回家。","source_cn":"我也准备收工了，等把开凿出来的矿石运到冶炼处，我就回家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22B02F908443E2D2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1320817005:1":{"text":"再见，朋友们！","source_cn":"再见，朋友们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2834D5BF973F7985","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:132